{"4423640":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Someday Youll Get There(언젠가는 도착해)","steam_appid":4423640,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Story<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After defeating all the monsters on the ground, the world seemed to have finally found peace.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, a beam of light rose from the schoolyard, and with it, the protagonist’s precious belongings scattered into the sky.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To retrieve what she lost and return home, she begins her climb upward.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toward the place she believes she will one day reach.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Game Features<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>One Goal: Reach 1,111m<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep climbing upward while collecting coins along the way.<br>Use the coins you gather to combine various buffs and create your own unique build.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different buff combinations lead to entirely different play styles.<br>Climb faster and more efficiently than anyone else to reach the summit.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Endless Battle Mode (Special Mode)<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relentless waves of monsters give you no time to rest.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this never-ending battle,<br>develop your own strategy and set a new high score.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Partner (Pet) System<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload your own image and climb together with your personalized partner (pet).<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※ Supported formats: JPG \/ PNG \/ GIF (Maximum size: 300 × 300)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Pixel Art + Analog Aesthetic<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charming world brought to life with cute pixel art.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-inspired colors and smooth animations create a warm atmosphere,<br>even during intense battles.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Story<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After defeating all the monsters on the ground, the world seemed to have finally found peace.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, a beam of light rose from the schoolyard, and with it, the protagonist’s precious belongings scattered into the sky.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To retrieve what she lost and return home, she begins her climb upward.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toward the place she believes she will one day reach.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Game Features<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>One Goal: Reach 1,111m<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep climbing upward while collecting coins along the way.<br>Use the coins you gather to combine various buffs and create your own unique build.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different buff combinations lead to entirely different play styles.<br>Climb faster and more efficiently than anyone else to reach the summit.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Endless Battle Mode (Special Mode)<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relentless waves of monsters give you no time to rest.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this never-ending battle,<br>develop your own strategy and set a new high score.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Partner (Pet) System<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload your own image and climb together with your personalized partner (pet).<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※ Supported formats: JPG \/ PNG \/ GIF (Maximum size: 300 × 300)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Pixel Art + Analog Aesthetic<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charming world brought to life with cute pixel art.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-inspired colors and smooth animations create a warm atmosphere,<br>even during intense battles.<\/p>","short_description":"All the monste